    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "I took a look at [FX-2274](https://algolia.atlassian.net/browse/FX-2274) with @aymeric-giraudet this morning.\r\nIf we keep the value as a `string`, it's working correctly (comma or dot), of course we don't do any validation this way, it's done by the browser, which force you to enter a valid number before submitting. We could cast it to number when we `refine`. WDYT?\r\n\r\n```suggestion\r\n    this.setState({\r\n      [key]: value,\r\n    });\r\n```",
    "commit_id": "10dc88a0281fd30efbcdb04d0babe3cded476d00",
